      {
        "id": "model-why-calibration",
        "moduleId": "goals-and-distortion",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "标定的价值",
        "markdown": "针孔相机把三维场景投影到二维像素，投影结果由相机自身的参数决定。标定就是把这些参数从图像中反求出来：一旦得到一组可靠的参数，同一台相机拍摄的其余图像都可以复用这组参数，而不必为每张照片重新估计。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-goal"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-distortion-kinds",
        "moduleId": "distortion-model",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "两类畸变",
        "markdown": "部分针孔相机会给图像带来明显畸变，主要有径向畸变和切向畸变。\n\n- **径向畸变**：本来笔直的线在图像中变成曲线，且离图像中心越远越明显。教材用棋盘格照片示意：两条本应笔直的棋盘边沿被标成红线，但棋盘边缘明显向外鼓出，与红线不重合。\n- **切向畸变**：拍摄透镜没有与成像平面完全平行，导致图像中某些区域看起来比预期的更近。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000105"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Camera Calibration",
                "Basics"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2008,
              "lineEnd": 2051,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_calib3d/py_calibration/images/calib_radial.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "9e3682fff5c869e9cc256b109a7651f19deddd83e3bf8286ace75bd8af59aa13"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-radial-formula",
        "moduleId": "distortion-model",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "径向畸变模型",
        "markdown": "径向畸变用下式描述，其中 $r$ 是像素到畸变中心的距离：\n\n$$x_{distorted} = x( 1 + k_1 r^2 + k_2 r^4 + k_3 r^6)$$\n\n$$y_{distorted} = y( 1 + k_1 r^2 + k_2 r^4 + k_3 r^6)$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000105"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Camera Calibration",
                "Basics"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2008,
              "lineEnd": 2051,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_calib3d/py_calibration/images/calib_radial.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "9e3682fff5c869e9cc256b109a7651f19deddd83e3bf8286ace75bd8af59aa13"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-tangential-formula",
        "moduleId": "distortion-model",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "切向畸变模型",
        "markdown": "切向畸变由透镜与成像平面不平行造成，可用下式表示：\n\n$$x_{distorted} = x + [2p_1xy + p_2(r^2 + 2x^2)]$$\n\n$$y_{distorted} = y + [p_1(r^2 + 2y^2) + 2p_2xy]$$\n\n综合两类畸变，需要求取的五个畸变系数为 $(k_1, k_2, p_1, p_2, k_3)$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000105"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Camera Calibration",
                "Basics"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2008,
              "lineEnd": 2051,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_calib3d/py_calibration/images/calib_radial.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "9e3682fff5c869e9cc256b109a7651f19deddd83e3bf8286ace75bd8af59aa13"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-distortion-intuition",
        "moduleId": "distortion-model",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "怎样读懂这两组公式",
        "markdown": "两组公式都是把理想坐标 $(x, y)$ 映射成实际观测到的畸变坐标。径向项以 $r^2$、$r^4$ 累积，离中心越远偏移越强，系数的正负和大小决定偏移方向与强度；切向项与 $xy$、$x^2$、$y^2$ 成正比，反映透镜倾斜带来的不均匀位移。实际相机通常以径向畸变为主，切向畸变较小，但两者的系数都要在标定中一起估计。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-radial-formula",
            "textbook-tangential-formula"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-intrinsics",
        "moduleId": "camera-parameters",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "内参：焦距与光心",
        "markdown": "内参是某台相机特有的信息，包括焦距 $(f_x, f_y)$ 和光心 $(c_x, c_y)$。它们可以组成 3×3 的相机矩阵：\n\n$$K = \\begin{bmatrix} f_x & 0 & c_x \\\\ 0 & f_y & c_y \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n教材指出，这个矩阵可用于校正该相机镜头带来的畸变；相机矩阵对一台相机是唯一的，因此计算一次后可以复用到同一台相机拍摄的其他图像上。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000105"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Camera Calibration",
                "Basics"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2008,
              "lineEnd": 2051,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_calib3d/py_calibration/images/calib_radial.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "9e3682fff5c869e9cc256b109a7651f19deddd83e3bf8286ace75bd8af59aa13"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-intrinsic-meaning",
        "moduleId": "camera-parameters",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "K 中各元素在做什么",
        "markdown": "$f_x$ 与 $f_y$ 是以像素为单位的焦距，分别反映水平与竖直方向的缩放比例；$c_x$ 与 $c_y$ 是光心（主点）在图像中的像素坐标，理想情况下接近图像中心，但会因装配误差偏离。矩阵把相机坐标系中归一化后的方向映射到像素坐标，是后续去畸变与三维投影的共同入口。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-intrinsics"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-extrinsics",
        "moduleId": "camera-parameters",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "外参：旋转与平移",
        "markdown": "外参由旋转向量和平移向量组成，它们把一个三维点的坐标转换到某一坐标系统中，用来描述相机与外部世界之间的相对位姿。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000105"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Camera Calibration",
