      {
        "id": "model-corner-order",
        "moduleId": "calibration-workflow",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "角点顺序为什么重要",
        "markdown": "校准方程依赖“第 $i$ 个对象点对应第 $i$ 个图像点”。教材强调角点按从左到右、从上到下的统一顺序排列，正是为了让不同图像中的对应关系保持一致；如果顺序错乱，就会把错误的点配成一对，解出的参数也会失去意义。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-corner-detection"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-calibrate-camera",
        "moduleId": "calibration-workflow",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "调用 calibrateCamera 求解",
        "markdown": "准备好对象点与图像点后，用 `cv.calibrateCamera()` 求解。它返回相机矩阵、畸变系数、旋转向量和平移向量等结果：\n\n```python\nret, mtx, dist, rvecs, tvecs = cv.calibrateCamera(\n    objpoints, imgpoints, gray.shape[::-1], None, None)\n```\n\n其中 `mtx` 是相机矩阵，`dist` 是畸变系数，`rvecs` 与 `tvecs` 是每张图像对应的外参。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000108"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Camera Calibration",
                "Code",
                "Calibration"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2138,
              "lineEnd": 2145,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "36447869fd70d13c7753fb33e7799701d6e0b51e766b7c71aeddf77ebadfd58f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-optimal-new-matrix",
        "moduleId": "undistortion",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "选取最优新相机矩阵",
        "markdown": "去畸变前，可先用 `cv.getOptimalNewCameraMatrix()` 依据自由缩放参数 `alpha` 调整相机矩阵。`alpha=0` 时返回的去畸变图像尽量少保留不需要的像素，因此可能裁掉图像四角的部分像素；`alpha=1` 时保留全部像素，但会多出一些黑色区域。该函数还会返回一个 ROI，可用于裁剪结果。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000109"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Camera Calibration",
                "Code",
                "Undistortion"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2146,
              "lineEnd": 2160,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "35578a807c7ba5b3e8e701a52b0a4814f6587510bb2c1f92fc5684fca1949439"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-alpha-tradeoff",
        "moduleId": "undistortion",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "alpha 怎么选",
        "markdown": "`alpha` 在两个目标之间权衡：偏小会裁掉更多边缘内容，但黑色边界更少；偏大能保留完整视野，却要接受额外黑边。选择时应看后续任务是否依赖图像边缘：需要检测画面四周的目标时宜保留视野，只关心中央区域时可以裁得更紧。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-optimal-new-matrix"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-undistort",
        "moduleId": "undistortion",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "方法一：cv.undistort",
        "markdown": "最直接的做法是调用 `cv.undistort()`，再按 ROI 裁剪：\n\n```python\ndst = cv.undistort(img, mtx, dist, None, newcameramtx)\nx, y, w, h = roi\ndst = dst[y:y+h, x:x+w]\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000110"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Camera Calibration",
                "Code",
                "Undistortion",
                "Using **cv.undistort()**"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2161,
              "lineEnd": 2172,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "343416ac3014b4d3c64ae6afa79f3065117632f1fd3ca47f0060f3c8884131b1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-remap",
        "moduleId": "undistortion",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "方法二：先建映射再重映射",
        "markdown": "另一种做法是先求出从畸变图像到去畸变图像的映射，再用 `cv.remap()` 重采样：\n\n```python\nmapx, mapy = cv.initUndistortRectifyMap(mtx, dist, None, newcameramtx, (w, h), 5)\ndst = cv.remap(img, mapx, mapy, cv.INTER_LINEAR)\n```\n\n两种方法得到的结果相同，结果中原本弯曲的边沿都会变直。得到相机矩阵和畸变系数后，可用 NumPy 的 `np.savez`、`np.savetxt` 等函数保存下来，供以后使用。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000111"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Camera Calibration",
                "Code",
