              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opencv/opencv/6d381e029fe26248675f48b2d44df23f4f288d11/doc/py_tutorials/py_calib3d/py_calibration/images/calib_result.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "3de7ff775ba5b1c0a91faac457b4ea5aaa4b182a3fc1fba6ad5b7836870bc3f5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-remap-advantage",
        "moduleId": "undistortion",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么还要学重映射",
        "markdown": "映射表只取决于相机参数、目标尺寸和重采样方式，与具体图像内容无关。因此对同一台相机、同一分辨率的连续图像，可以只计算一次 `mapx`、`mapy` 并重复使用，避免每帧重新推导映射；这也是处理视频序列时更常用的做法。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-remap"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-reprojection-error",
        "moduleId": "quality-and-check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "重投影误差",
        "markdown": "重投影误差用来估计求得的参数有多准确：误差越接近零，参数越准确。做法是用内参、畸变系数、旋转和平移，把对象点通过 `cv.projectPoints()` 投影成图像点，再与角点检测得到的图像点比较；对所有点和所有图像的平均平方误差开方，就得到均方根误差（RMSE）：\n\n```python\nmean_error = 0\nfor i in range(len(objpoints)):\n    imgpoints2, _ = cv.projectPoints(objpoints[i], rvecs[i], tvecs[i], mtx, dist)\n    error = cv.norm(imgpoints[i], imgpoints2, cv.NORM_L2SQR) / len(imgpoints2)\n    mean_error += error\nprint('total error: {}'.format(np.sqrt(mean_error / len(objpoints))))\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d3ee7029633f5d1e838fcfae",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000112"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "局部特征与几何视觉",
                "Camera Calibration",
                "Re-projection Error"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2196,
              "lineEnd": 2210,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "e6929166ea355cc44143d326817f29ad8d93ecc8923854924f015f4f5643ce0c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-error-interpretation",
        "moduleId": "quality-and-check",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "怎样用误差定位问题",
        "markdown": "重投影误差以像素为单位，衡量模型投影与检测角点之间的偏差。除了看总体 RMSE，还可以逐张图像比较：某张图像的误差明显偏大，通常说明该图的角点检测不准、图像模糊，或棋盘格位姿过于倾斜。误差大小要结合相机分辨率和任务精度要求判断，而不是盯住一个固定阈值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-reprojection-error"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
